The contents of `dump/` are unmodified factory data extracted from the device
— the machine's own ACPI tables, the PnP device list and a scoped registry
extract from the factory OS — and are NOT covered by this license; they are
included as documentation under the original vendor's terms. The same applies
to `patch/acpi-override/SSDT27_TPD0.aml` and `.dsl`, which are that factory
table with one statement moved.

Third-party work carried here keeps its own licence and authorship: the patches
under `patch/fingerprint/sensors/` are other people's, each with its origin
recorded in the `recipe.conf` beside it; `patch/fan/honor-ec-sensors.c` and
`patch/keyboard-atkbd/*.patch` are GPL-2.0, as their headers state.
